@startuml
title RF49 — Teto salarial rígido e contratos · Máquina de estados: PlayerContract (ciclo de vida)
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #FFF7EE
skinparam StateBorderColor #DC5B26
state "ACTIVE" as ACTIVE
ACTIVE : cap hit do ano
state "Em negociação" as NEGOTIATING
NEGOTIATING : proposta e contraproposta
state "Reestruturado" as RESTRUCTURED
RESTRUCTURED : base → bônus rateado
state "Último ano" as EXPIRING
state "Franchise tag" as TAGGED
TAGGED : 1 ano
TAGGED : 1 por franquia
state "Cortado" as RELEASED
RELEASED : dead money no ledger
RELEASED : waivers (RF65)
state "Vencido" as EXPIRED
EXPIRED : agente livre
[*] --> ACTIVE
ACTIVE --> NEGOTIATING : proposta de extensão
NEGOTIATING --> ACTIVE : ACCEPT (novo contrato) / REJECT
NEGOTIATING --> NEGOTIATING : COUNTER
ACTIVE --> RESTRUCTURED : reestrutura
RESTRUCTURED --> ACTIVE : nova temporada
ACTIVE --> EXPIRING : último ano
EXPIRING --> NEGOTIATING : proposta
EXPIRING --> TAGGED : franchise tag
EXPIRING --> EXPIRED : fim da temporada sem decisão
TAGGED --> NEGOTIATING : extensão longa
TAGGED --> EXPIRED : fim do ano da tag
ACTIVE --> RELEASED : corte confirmado
EXPIRING --> RELEASED : corte confirmado
RELEASED --> [*]
EXPIRED --> [*]
@enduml
